Order a crêpe in France 🥞🇫🇷 Say THIS

• une crêpe = a crêpe
• au chocolat = with chocolate
• la chantilly = whipped cream
• attention, c'est chaud = careful, it's hot
• gardez la monnaie = keep the change

🥞 Sweet or savoury? Comment "sucré" or "salé" 👇
💌 Save this for your next crêperie
👯 Send it to a friend with a sweet tooth

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

